 device, mchfuse try to determine if it is locally\nreachable, otherwise it uses the external endpoint.\n\nThe reachability check runs every 30 seconds (to allow transition from\nExternal to Internal endpoint in case the device become reachable\nlocally) or when an API call returns a connection error (to allow a\nquick transition from Internal to External endpoint if the device\nbecome unreachable locally).", "created_at": "2020-05-27T21:39:32Z", "repo": "mchfuse", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b7fddc8b9ecc067d3b3da519bbd25cf6d102e2c5", "message": "Wrap Device api call in a dedicated funcion\n\nThis function can intercept eventual errors and will make easier to\nsupport accessing the Device through the external endpoint.", "created_at": "2020-05-27T06:56:35Z", "repo": "mchfuse", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1d3f04244175251e9f95ba6af7ba0af54967294b", "message": "Improve documentation\n\n* add prerequisite section\n* add running in backgroud note\n* add write performance known limit\n\nThis closes #4, closes #5 and try to improve #6", "created_at": "2020-05-27T06:30:22Z", "repo": "mchfuse", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "22e183ee9165c5645cf1d3961cdb3dc758c294e6", "message": "Improve visibility of note about `--allow-other` option", "created_at": "2020-05-18T08:42:56Z", "repo": "mchfuse", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "582ad81f07dcf96478cb7b945f0316e7d4e289f3", "message": "Clarify the `Quick start` section in the README\n\nThis closes #2 and #3", "created_at": "2020-05-18T08:18:59Z", "repo": "mchfuse", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "464c2561aa57da668ab05199f25abe458d3f54e6", "message": "Support golangci-lint version 1.27.0\n\nEnable more linters:\n\n- asciicheck\n- goerr113\n- nolintlint", "created_at": "2020-05-18T07:43:36Z", "re